protections.text:
Keep everything #38 settled:

- the Tidbyt rotation tile;
- the Pixoo Monitor pop-up and the Media Off, Pop-up and Whole song setting;
- the 15 s Tidbyt gate and the 2 s Pixoo poll;
- the stale and removal rules;
- one writer per device.

The text-only card stays the fallback. Artwork from an earlier track or source is never shown on the current one.

acceptance.text:
Fake-clock tests cover:
- interlude then restore, in Work and in Free;
- pre-emption by an alert;
- a mode change mid-interlude;
- restart mid-interlude, with no replay and a correct base;
- a duplicate idempotency key.

The shared conformance cases pass. There is a live check when requested.

implementation.text:
- **Layout-read spacing margin (review P-S8):** `scripts/verify/steps.mjs` requires tolerated layout reads to be at least 9.9 s apart, which leaves about 100 ms of slack against the map's 10 s cadence (measured gaps: 10003-10010 ms). A read recorded more than about 100 ms late would make a correct map fail `device-read-refused`, and would make `doctor` report `device-boundary: failed` on a long-lived `layout-unavailable` preview. That is a false failure, never a false pass. Widen `apartMs` to about 9 s, or record a monotonic time in each boundary entry, and update the spec and guide.
- **Rebinding guard coverage (review S8):** `tests/test_module_dependencies.py` `rebinding_problems` misses some ordinary spellings:
  - `importlib.import_module(...)` and `sys.modules[...]` roots;
  - a module aliased to a local name;
  - class attributes reached through a module, such as `wall_server.App.state = ...`;
  - `setattr` bound to another name or reached through `getattr`.

  Resolve each assignment target's attribute chain to its root, flag rebinding of `setattr`, and add the class-attribute and `import_module` forms as permanent failing cases.

acceptance.text:
- Fake hub and fake player tests cover:
  - the card render;
  - the Monitor pop-up and its attention cut-short;
  - Media Off, Pop-up and Whole song, with resume, manual-cancel, screen-off and not-playing cases;
  - stale and failed-read handling;
  - the persisted setting and the unchanged integration snapshot.
- Browser tests cover the settings control.
- `npm run check` and `npm run test:browser` pass.
- The owner approves the settings UI.
- Delivery target: source-only. Installing the updated app and checking the physical Pixoo need the owner's separate go-ahead.
